<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5336" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμμορος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, poet.
		for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμοιρος</span> (q. v.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without share of, without lot
			in,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμμορος . . λοετρῶν Ὠκεανοῖο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.489
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.275
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					1.84
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					182
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέκνων ἄ.</span>
			<i>bereft of</i> children, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				421
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄ. ἀμφὶ πάλᾳ κυναγέτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					6.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἐσθλῆς ἐλπίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1942.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later, simply,
				<i>free from, without,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. κακότητος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					1.430
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs.,
				<i>ill-fated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.408
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.773
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ-</span> priv., <i>smor-,</i>
			cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάσμορος.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
